    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup required\n1. Set the recipient in **Build Daily Period**.\n2. Set the reporting API URL in **Generate Report**.\n3. Add an n8n Header Auth credential: `X-API-Key`.\n4. Connect Google Sheets OAuth2 on all three Sheet nodes.\n5. Connect Gmail OAuth2 on **Send Report Email**.\n6. Test manually before activating.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7a8265e1-a0a1-47a4-889e-c0a31a9bb110",
      "name": "Setup Required",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-900, -380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reliability behavior\n- `report_key` is stable for the report name and UTC period.\n- Existing delivered keys stop before another email is sent.\n- The first Sheet upsert records generation before email delivery.\n- The second upsert marks the same row delivered only after Gmail succeeds.\n- Raw business records stay inside the Python service.\n- The workflow imports inactive and runs daily at 08:00 UTC.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "7a8265e1-a0a1-47a4-889e-c0a31a9bb111",
      "name": "Reliability Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, -380]
    }
